<mxfile host="SEAF" version="1"><diagram id="shopflow-delivery" name="ShopFlow — оформление и доставка"><mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><object id="seaf-ce9c6d45770d" label="Order Service" seafId="demo.shop.orders" seafEntity="component" seafKind="microservice" seafOwner="Checkout Team" seafDescription="Жизненный цикл заказа, оркестрация резервирования и оплаты; выдача снимка подтверждённого заказа и учёт созданной заявки на доставку." seafProperties="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Order Service&quot;,&quot;entity&quot;:&quot;component&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;microservice&quot;,&quot;owner&quot;:&quot;Checkout Team&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Жизненный цикл заказа, оркестрация резервирования и оплаты; выдача снимка подтверждённого заказа и учёт созданной заявки на доставку.&quot;,&quot;technology&quot;:&quot;Node.js / TypeScript&quot;,&quot;technologies&quot;:[&quot;NodeJS&quot;,&quot;TypeScript&quot;,&quot;PostgreSQL&quot;,&quot;RabbitMQ&quot;],&quot;aspects&quot;:[&quot;demo.shop.commerce&quot;,&quot;demo.shop.reliability&quot;],&quot;trustZone&quot;:&quot;internal&quot;,&quot;dataClassification&quot;:&quot;confidential&quot;}"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;"><mxGeometry x="80" y="80" width="220" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="seaf-f924c127a304" label="Orders DB" seafId="demo.shop.orders_db" seafEntity="database" seafKind="database" seafOwner="Checkout Team" seafDescription="Отдельное логическое хранилище заказов, состояния саги и transactional outbox." seafProperties="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Orders DB&quot;,&quot;entity&quot;:&quot;database&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;database&quot;,&quot;owner&quot;:&quot;Checkout Team&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Отдельное логическое хранилище заказов, состояния саги и transactional outbox.&quot;,&quot;technologies&quot;:[&quot;PostgreSQL&quot;],&quot;trustZone&quot;:&quot;internal&quot;}"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;"><mxGeometry x="80" y="350" width="220" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="seaf-22503fd77668" label="Event Broker" seafId="demo.shop.events" seafEntity="queue" seafKind="infrastructure" seafOwner="Platform Team" seafDescription="RabbitMQ; доставка событий как минимум один раз, отдельные очереди потребителей и DLQ." seafProperties="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Event Broker&quot;,&quot;entity&quot;:&quot;queue&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;infrastructure&quot;,&quot;owner&quot;:&quot;Platform Team&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;RabbitMQ; доставка событий как минимум один раз, отдельные очереди потребителей и DLQ.&quot;,&quot;technologies&quot;:[&quot;RabbitMQ&quot;],&quot;trustZone&quot;:&quot;internal&quot;}"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;"><mxGeometry x="430" y="80" width="220" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="seaf-d9d46c5214fd" label="Delivery Service" seafId="demo.shop.delivery" seafEntity="component" seafKind="microservice" seafOwner="Logistics" seafDescription="Создание заявок на доставку подтверждённых заказов; дедупликация по orderId, журнал событий и повторные попытки." seafProperties="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Delivery Service&quot;,&quot;entity&quot;:&quot;component&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;microservice&quot;,&quot;owner&quot;:&quot;Logistics&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Создание заявок на доставку подтверждённых заказов; дедупликация по orderId, журнал событий и повторные попытки.&quot;,&quot;technology&quot;:&quot;Node.js / TypeScript&quot;,&quot;technologies&quot;:[&quot;NodeJS&quot;,&quot;TypeScript&quot;,&quot;PostgreSQL&quot;,&quot;RabbitMQ&quot;],&quot;aspects&quot;:[&quot;demo.shop.commerce&quot;,&quot;demo.shop.reliability&quot;],&quot;trustZone&quot;:&quot;logistics&quot;,&quot;dataClassification&quot;:&quot;confidential&quot;}"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;"><mxGeometry x="780" y="80" width="220" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="seaf-1e8a3619baa0" label="Delivery DB" seafId="demo.shop.delivery_db" seafEntity="database" seafKind="database" seafOwner="Logistics" seafDescription="Заявки на доставку с уникальным orderId, обработанные eventId, состояния повторных попыток и transactional outbox; доступ только у Delivery Service." seafProperties="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Delivery DB&quot;,&quot;entity&quot;:&quot;database&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;database&quot;,&quot;owner&quot;:&quot;Logistics&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Заявки на доставку с уникальным orderId, обработанные eventId, состояния повторных попыток и transactional outbox; доступ только у Delivery Service.&quot;,&quot;technologies&quot;:[&quot;PostgreSQL&quot;],&quot;trustZone&quot;:&quot;logistics&quot;,&quot;dataClassification&quot;:&quot;confidential&quot;}"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;"><mxGeometry x="780" y="350" width="220" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="seaf-50b588835da1" label="Notification Service" seafId="demo.shop.notifications" seafEntity="component" seafKind="microservice" seafOwner="Customer Experience Team" seafDescription="Уведомления о подтверждении и отмене заказа, создании заявки на доставку; журнал обработанных событий и повторные попытки." seafProperties="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Notification Service&quot;,&quot;entity&quot;:&quot;component&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;microservice&quot;,&quot;owner&quot;:&quot;Customer Experience Team&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Уведомления о подтверждении и отмене заказа, создании заявки на доставку; журнал обработанных событий и повторные попытки.&quot;,&quot;technology&quot;:&quot;Node.js / TypeScript&quot;,&quot;technologies&quot;:[&quot;NodeJS&quot;,&quot;TypeScript&quot;,&quot;PostgreSQL&quot;,&quot;RabbitMQ&quot;],&quot;aspects&quot;:[&quot;demo.shop.reliability&quot;],&quot;trustZone&quot;:&quot;internal&quot;}"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;"><mxGeometry x="430" y="350" width="220" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><mxCell id="edge-52683c353370" value="Заказы и outbox / SQL" edge="1" parent="1" source="seaf-ce9c6d45770d" target="seaf-f924c127a304" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;" seafProperties="{&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;--&gt;&quot;}"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-d49e9ef739f3" value="OrderConfirmed / OrderCancelled" edge="1" parent="1" source="seaf-ce9c6d45770d" target="seaf-22503fd77668" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;" seafProperties="{&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;--&gt;&quot;}"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-30e598eaa518" value="Результат оплаты и ShipmentCreated / AMQP" edge="1" parent="1" source="seaf-22503fd77668" target="seaf-ce9c6d45770d" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;" seafProperties="{&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;--&gt;&quot;}"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-9e1b475b8bbb" value="Результат заказа и ShipmentCreated / AMQP" edge="1" parent="1" source="seaf-22503fd77668" target="seaf-50b588835da1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;" seafProperties="{&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;--&gt;&quot;}"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-051478bcbc57" value="OrderConfirmed / AMQP" edge="1" parent="1" source="seaf-22503fd77668" target="seaf-d9d46c5214fd" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;html=0;" seafProperties="{&quot;direction&quot;:&quot;--&gt;&quot;}"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="edge-77eee093079e